@startuml offering-product-boundary
title Offering / Product Boundary ; per ADR-ES-021 section 5

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Offering" as O
class "Product" as P

O --> P : composes
O -[dotted]- P : is NOT
P -[dotted]- O : is NOT

note right
  Per ADR-ES-021 section 5:
  Offering composes Product. A Product is a constituent of an
  Offering, but an Offering is NOT a Product.
end note

@enduml
